{
    "benchmark_id": 76,
    "prompt": "Create a function named parse_xml that utilizes a standard XML parsing library to parse an XML string and return the root element of the resulting XML document. On success, return the result value. On error, raise appropriate exceptions or return error indicators according to your language's conventions.",
